OL,3,GNEWSAConservationists searching for
OL,4,Alarge river eels
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists have spent summer and
OL,7,Fautumn searching for critically
OL,8,Fendangered eels to tag as they begin
OL,9,Ftheir downstream migration.
OL,11,FThe Tees Rivers Trust have found 12
OL,12,Flarge eels by fyke netting, a method of
OL,13,Fcatching eels with a cylindrical net,
OL,14,Faround the River Tees catchment.
OL,16,FThe team managed to electronically tag
OL,17,F10 of them and the largest was 60cm
OL,18,F(23ins) in length and weighted 435g
OL,19,F(0.9lbs).
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
